SUMMARY:✨ Better Together: Courageous Conversations for Racial Healing 
 ✨
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**✨ Better Together: 
 Courageous Conversations for Racial Healing ✨**\n\n📆 2nd Sunday of ea
 ch month\n🕰 Start Time: 12:30 PM\n\nBetter Together’s mission is to e
 mpower a racial awakening by building authentic relationships and deepenin
 g our understanding of our true connection to one another.\n\n**💬 What 
 to Expect**\n🤝 Participate in — or simply observe — honest and some
 times challenging conversations\n❤️ Dialogue always grounded in love\,
  compassion\, and respect for diverse perspectives\n🌈 An opportunity to
  experience diversity\, healing\, and inclusion in community\n🎤 Occasio
 nal guest speakers and special programs that enrich the conversation\n\nAl
 l are welcome. Come as you are\, listen deeply\, speak authentically\, and
  discover how we are truly better together.\n\n#BetterTogether #RacialHeal
 ing #BelovedCommunity #CommunityDialogue #InclusionAndBelonging #SacredCon
 versation #CommunityCommonsAsheville #CSLAsheville
