SUMMARY:🌟 Vision Board Workshop 🌟
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# 🌟 Vision Board Wor
 kshop 🌟\n\n### Dream It. See It. Live Into It.\n\nStep away from the da
 y-to-day\, get clear on what matters most\, and create a vision for what
 ’s next. Join us for a fun and meaningful **Vision Board Workshop** desi
 gned to help you identify your dreams and goals—and begin turning your v
 ision into action and reality. ✨\n\n### 🌈 In This Workshop\, You Will
 :\n\n💭 **Reflect** on what matters most and identify meaningful dreams 
 and goals.\n🖼️ **Create a personal vision board** using magazines and
  poster board.\n✨ **Choose images** that capture the feeling and essence
  of what you want.\n🎯 **Learn practical ways** to keep your vision visi
 ble and start turning it into action and reality.\nThis is an opportunity 
 to pause\, dream big\, and give yourself the space to imagine what’s pos
 sible. 💫\n\n### 📅 Workshop Details\n\n📆 **Sunday\, October 11**\n
 ⏰ **3:00 – 6:00 PM**\n📍 **Center for Spiritual Living Asheville**\n
 \n💚 **Free — Donations Welcome**\n\n### 🌟 Facilitated By\n\n**Jean
  Van’t Hul**\, author of *Vision Board Magic: A Practical Guide to Manif
 esting Success\, Happiness & Abundance*\nCome create something that reflec
 ts the life you want to move toward—and let your vision become a visible
  reminder of what matters most. 🌻\n**DREAM IT. SEE IT. LIVE INTO IT.**\
 n#VisionBoardWorkshop #VisionBoard #DreamBig #LiveWithPurpose #Manifesting
  #DreamItSeeItLiveIt #PersonalGrowth #GoalSetting #CreativeVisualization #
 AshevilleNC #CommunityCommonsAsheville #CSLAsheville
